{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"random-walks-pagerank","title":"随机游走与 PageRank","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice/random-walks-pagerank","wordCount":1644,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"expander-graphs","title":"扩展图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice/expander-graphs","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-computation","title":"谱计算与数值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/spectral-graph-theory/practice/spectral-computation","wordCount":1656,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实践\">实践</h1><p>理论与应用都建好了，这一章回答最后两个现实问题：谱在动态过程里意味着什么，以及怎么把谱真正算出来。三篇文档把抽象的特征值落到能跑的算法和能造的网络上。</p>\n<p>第一篇 <a href=\"random-walks-pagerank\">随机游走与 PageRank</a> 给谱一个动力学解释。在图上随机走，转移矩阵的谱决定走多久才&quot;忘记&quot;起点（混合时间）；第二大特征值越小，混得越快。PageRank 就是这套理论最著名的落地——它求的稳态分布本质是一个特征向量，而它收敛快慢由谱间隙控制。这一篇把前面静态的谱接到随机过程上。</p>\n<p>第二篇 <a href=\"expander-graphs\">扩展图</a> 走向极致：那些谱间隙最大、随机游走混得最快、又最稀疏的图。它讲扩展图的三种等价刻画（谱、组合、混合）、Ramanujan 图这一最优界，以及它们在纠错码、伪随机、算法里的用途，并引用 2025 年关于随机图 Ramanujan 性的最新结果。</p>\n<p>第三篇 <a href=\"spectral-computation\">谱计算与数值</a> 是工程落地的总结。它讲清为什么不能对大图做完整特征分解，幂迭代/Lanczos/LOBPCG 这些只算少数极端特征对的迭代法各自的取舍，以及 SciPy、scikit-learn、NetworkX 在 2026 年的实际接口。前面所有篇章里&quot;求几个特征向量&quot;那一步的真正实现都在这里。</p>\n<p>在 hub 中的位置：这一章是落地层，回收前三章的全部概念——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、Fiedler 向量、Cheeger、谱嵌入都在这里被算出来或用于动态分析。前置是前三章。</p>\n"}